[8485]={"Panier à chat (Bombay)","Donni Anthania plans to have a bombay buried with her when she dies. A wise adventurer can put its talents to much better use.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8486]={"Panier à chat (Cornouailles)","Donni Anthania invites these cats to her tea parties. But she doesn't serve their favorite drink: the tears of their enemies.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8487]={"Panier à chat (tigré orange)","The last person who tried to housebreak this cat quickly learned that a soiled rug is better than a shredded everything-else.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8488]={"Panier à chat (tigré argent)","Sleeping is this cat's second favorite activity. The first is yawning.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8489]={"Panier à chat (chaton blanc)","The queen had three kittens. The first gave her a juicy rat. The second, a tasty hare. And the white, her favorite, presented the head of her rival.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8490]={"Panier à chat (Siamois)","Known for its blue eyes. Also considered a delicacy by giant murlocs.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8491]={"Panier à chat (tigré noir)","Old Alterac saying: 'A cat has nine lives, but needs only one.'","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8492]={"Cage de perroquet (ara ailes vertes)","Favored pet of the Defias pirates, this colorful bird is handy for remembering passwords, grocery lists, and cracker recipes.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8494]={"Cage de perroquet (ara jacinthe)","The jungle trolls train these birds to mimic calls for help in order to lure unsuspecting travelers into traps.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8495]={"Cage de perroquet (sénégal)","Favored pet of the goblins of Booty Bay, this colorful bird is renowned for its ability to count coins, tally budgets, and lie about contracts.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8496]={"Cage de perroquet (cockatiel)","Some say this clever bird can be taught to speak--but it's smart enough to keep its beak shut.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8497]={"Caisse de lapin (patte-blanche)","If you go chasing snowshoe rabbits, you know you're going to fall.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8498]={"Minuscule jeune dragonnet d'émeraude","Once bred and raised by the green dragon Itharius, this unique breed of dragon has settled in the jungles of Feralas.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8499]={"Minuscule jeune dragonnet cramoisi","Hailing from the Wetlands, this young dragon is just learning how to hunt, breathe fire, and go on cute destructive rampages.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8500]={"Grande chouette cornue","Night elf children are given an owl feather on their first birthday as a token of good luck.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
[8501]={"Chouette-faucon","This dark-feathered bird of prey is often seen as a harbinger of doom amongst the druids of Teldrassil.","Vous apprend à invoquer ce compagnon."},
