[13322]={"Mécanotrotteur non peint","A work in progress, waiting for its true colors to be revealed.","Vous apprend à invoquer cette monture."},
[13326]={"Mécanotrotteur blanc modèle B","Forced to recall the model after numerous complaints of an \"uncontrollable throttle\", Gnomish engineers now refer to a proto-type blunder as a \"model B\".","Vous apprend à invoquer cette monture. C'est une monture très rapide."},
[13327]={"Mécanotrotteur bleu clair modèle A","This historic piece of gnomish engineering was forced into retirement due to its extremely \"touchy\" gyroscometer.","Vous apprend à invoquer cette monture. C'est une monture très rapide."},
[13328]={"Bélier noir","I've not seen this breed in ages, but when they're ram tough they stick around. - Veron Amberstill.","Vous apprend à invoquer cette monture. C'est une monture très rapide."},
[13329]={"Bélier de givre","Male rams will often smash their thick skulls against each other for hours to impress a female. In that way, they're very similar to dwarves.","Vous apprend à invoquer cette monture. C'est une monture très rapide."},
[13331]={"Cheval squelette rouge","The Forsaken believe that without a purpose, even beasts of burden suffer in undeath.","Vous apprend à invoquer cette monture."},
[13332]={"Cheval squelette bleu","The Forsaken believe that without a purpose, even beasts of burden suffer in undeath.","Vous apprend à invoquer cette monture."},
