[13334]={"Cheval de guerre squelette vert","When fallen heroes are raised into undeath, so too are their horses.","Vous apprend à invoquer cette monture. C'est une monture très rapide."},
[13335]={"Rênes de destrier de la mort","When Baron Rivendare became a champion of the Scourge, he condemned his favorite horse to join him in undeath.","Vous apprend à invoquer la monture du baron Vaillefendre. C'est une monture très rapide."},
